.TH tkutlfmt n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutlfmt
.PP
Per\-column display formatting for a \fBtablelist\fR widget via
\fB\-formatcommand\fR. The raw cell value is unchanged (so sorting/filtering see
the number); only the shown text is formatted. Pairs with \fBtkutlsort\fR.
.SS Commands
.CS
::tkutils::tkutlfmt::column  tbl col type ?options?
::tkutils::tkutlfmt::columns tbl {col type ?{options}? ...}
.CE
.SS Types
.PP
\fBinteger\fR (1.234.567), \fBnumber\fR (1.234,56), \fBcurrency\fR (1.234,56 \(eu),
\fBpercent\fR (12,5 %), \fBdate\fR (clock reformat). Numeric types right\-align.
.SS Options
.PP
\fB\-locale\fR eu|us, \fB\-decimals\fR, \fB\-group\fR, \fB\-decimal\fR,
\fB\-symbol\fR, \fB\-symbolpos\fR pre|post, \fB\-align\fR; date:
\fB\-informat\fR, \fB\-outformat\fR.
.SS "Error codes"
\fB\-errorcode {TKUTILS TKUTLFMT <REASON>}\fR (TYPE, OPTION, LOCALE).
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkutlsort(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
tablelist, format, currency, percent, date
